    "description": "Tokushu Tokai Paper Co., Ltd. manufactures, processes, and sells paper products in Japan. It offers special material products, such as fancy, high-grade printer, canvas, functional, security, and information-use papers, as well as papers for protection and preservation. The company also provides industrial material products comprising containerboards, kraft papers, and converting papers. In addition, it offers household products, including paper towels, paper for food material, paper wipers, gifts, toilet papers, and laminated products; recycling of plastics, metals, glass, and crushed stones; manufacture and use of refuse paper and plastic fuel and biomass fuel; reduce CO2 emissions; and engages in production of solar and wind power. Further, the company involved in waste collection and transportation; intermediate waste treatment; whiskey business; harnessing Ikawa forest; construction and civil engineering business; and agricultural and forestry landscaping business. Additionally, it engages in the transportation, warehousing, and heavy machinery; manufacture and sale of pulp mould; and landscaping, forestry, and tourism. Tokushu Tokai Paper Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in Chiyoda, Japan."
